@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFEF9
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #456B65
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #E7EEE5
title Completion transaction (detail of game-sequence)
participant "UI / Controller" as UI
participant GameFacade as F
participant JsonGameRepository as R
participant ChapterCompletedPublisher as P
participant ProgressObserver as O1
participant CompletionStatisticsObserver as O2
UI -> F : finish(attemptId)
F -> R : transaction(candidate)
R -> R : copy persisted state
F -> F : validate stage; complete(passed)
F -> P : ChapterCompleted(attemptId, playerId, chapterId, passed)
P -> O1 : onCompleted(event, candidate)
O1 -> O1 : dedupe; update mastered chapters
P -> O2 : onCompleted(event, candidate)
O2 -> O2 : dedupe; count passed / failed
F -> R : persist candidate
R -> R : temp + force + ATOMIC_MOVE
R -> R : publish in memory after commit
F --> UI : allowed result DTO
note over F,R
Persistent write error: 503, old state retained.
Repeated finish: same result, no new event.
end note
@enduml
